# LOOP — environment template.
# Copy to .env and adjust for your environment. The real .env is
# gitignored (external audit, finding 7) — it was previously committed
# with only a local sqlite path inside (no credential), but the hygiene
# rule stands: environment files never ride in git history.
#
# DATABASE_URL — absolute file: URL to the SQLite database. Prisma needs
# the absolute form when the working directory differs between the dev
# server and spawned child processes (verifier, schema canary).
# Replace /path/to with your checkout location.
DATABASE_URL=file:/path/to/your/checkout/db/custom.db

# Optional: geo-bypass reverse proxy for the direct-Gemini fallback path
# (see /proxy/README.md). Leave unset to disable.
# GEMINI_PROXY_BASE_URL=
